METRICS: as exp40 (flooder_total = sum of the eBPF means over the own windows, min_flooder_own, min_flooder_ovl over 18-28 s, budget shares and high-cap shares for vfrot/vffair, Jain over the same window); exp41: flooderX_offered_gbps = eBPF passed + dropped over the own window (what the guest really offered: B's UDP rate is not reduced by the cap)
